      "text": "let's book spirometry to look into wheeze i'm going to order serial peak flow readings for work-related wheeze it's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture the treatment will be beclometasone inhaler 200 micrograms twice a day long term it's for asthma record peak flows at work and at home for four weeks occupational health would be the right next step I'll refer you"
